rpresser wrote:
> I know how to get into wizard mode for 3.4.3. I haven't had any success with Nethack4, though. How is it done?
For local play, -X on the command line when starting.

It's possible that, as can happen with vanilla, wizard mode isn't
compiled into your version. There's an option to choose which user is
allowed to use wizard mode that's set at configure time; that might be
different depending on what build system you're using. (Also, it changed
recently, and the binary I just tested on predates that, so if
you're on a very new version, it's possible it's been recently broken.)

